{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15078","headline":"忆游天台寄道流 · 张佐","name":"忆游天台寄道流","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆昨天台到赤城，几朝仙籁耳中生。\n云龙出水风声急，海鹤鸣臯日色清。\n石笋半山移步险，桂花当涧拂衣轻。\n今来尽是人间梦，刘阮茫茫何处行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张佐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15078.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15078","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}